gbɛ̃ zaaanↄoro.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ma ↄ pìpi ma taarisaidekɛ sèeda ũ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mɛ́ɛ ligaa n gbãgbãkiizi, Dii,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"lɛ mà e mà n sáabu kpá lɛ̀sina guu,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mɛ́ n yãbↄnsaɛnↄ kpàakpa kɛ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Dii, má ye n kpɛ́ kɛ̀ nɛɛ̀gↄ̃ kúnzi,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"guu kɛ̀ n gakui è pitan.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Ǹton ma kakↄ̃a kↄ̃n durunkɛrinↄoro,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ǹton ma baka kakↄ̃a kↄ̃n gbɛ̃dɛrinↄ pↄ́oro.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Laasuu zaaa bé ègↄ̃ dↄↄńnɛ aɛ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"aↄ̃ ↄↄ ègↄ̃ pana kↄ̃n ↄdↄnkpɛɛgbaanↄ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mapi sↄ̃, mɛɛ̀ yã kɛ a zɛ́a,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ǹ ma wɛ̃nda gwa, ǹ ma mì sí.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"Ma zɛkii è gu maaan,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mɛ́ Dii sáabu kpá pari kakↄ̃ana guu.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/bus_sim/PSA/26.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/bus_sim/PSA/27.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/bus_sim/PSA/25.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}